{"id": "tea:siddhantamuktavali:2", "source": "src:siddhantamuktavali", "location": {"ref": "2"}, "paraphrase": "Service (sevā) is the mind flowing toward him; to accomplish it there is service with body and with wealth; from that comes cessation of the sorrow of saṃsāra and the knowledge of Brahman.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "devotional", "naya": null, "path": ["devotion"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["practice"], "coverage": ["A6"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "ai_translated": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U16-bhedabheda"], "disagreements": []}, "original": {"text": "cetas tat-pravaṇaṃ sevā tat-siddhyai tanu-vittajā | tataḥ saṃsāra-duḥkhasya nivṛttir brahma-bodhanam ||", "script": "IAST", "edition": "recalled from the standard text (skeleton); verify in Phase D", "licence": "public domain (pre-modern text)"}, "teachers": ["tch:vallabha"], "practices": ["prc:pusti-seva"], "terms": ["trm:seva", "trm:manasi-seva"], "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U16-bhedabheda"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:siddhantamuktavali:3-6", "source": "src:siddhantamuktavali", "location": {"ref": "3-6"}, "paraphrase": "The one reality appears in three ways, like the Gaṅgā: to the worldly as mere water, to the ritualist as a sacred river conferring merit, to the devotee as a goddess; so Brahman is seen as the world, as Akṣara Brahman and as Puruṣottama.", "tags": {"level": "bridging", "standpoint": "devotional", "naya": null, "path": ["devotion", "knowledge"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["ultimate"], "coverage": ["A6"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "ai_translated": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U16-bhedabheda"], "disagreements": []}, "teachers": ["tch:vallabha"], "concepts": ["cpt:three-forms-of-brahman-vallabha"], "terms": ["trm:aksara-brahman", "trm:purusottama"], "notes": "Verse range approximate.", "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "low", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U16-bhedabheda"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
